ime-info - Freedesktop common MIME database```\nnettleはどこ・・・？","ts":"1622375981.471400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4eL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87c6dc6c-38de-4b12-9a0d-b15557dad29f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"```[u1@98e7d44c2fbd gnutls-3.6.16]$ pkg-config gmp --libs-only-L\n-L/home/u1/.local/lib\n[u1@98e7d44c2fbd gnutls-3.6.16]$ LDFLAGS=$(pkg-config gmp --libs-only-L) ./configure --prefix=$PREFIX```\nこうしたらgmpじゃなくてnettleがないと言われるようになった 一歩前進？","ts":"1622375811.470400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M2a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20c0b997-04ac-4cb8-ba51-82853545c046","type":"message","user":"U7986PPFH","text":"`GMP_LIBS=\"$(pkg-config --libs)\"` これ `GMP_LIBS=\"$(pkg-config gmp --libs)\"` の間違い？","ts":"1622375775.469400","thread_ts":"1622375775.469400","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nVdWT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c6ce5d7-7b67-4371-b3f0-02aa73752df5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、そういやそうか...?","ts":"1622375714.468700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+/K/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"979a75b1-2563-4ee3-bc2f-d91f2a81bf14","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`LDFLANG` に `-L` でライブラリのパスを指定すれば良さそうな気がしますが","ts":"1622375696.468500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UqRM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78673ef2-1ff6-42ff-97af-f969ab8a640a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"Libnettleも見つからねーぞと怒られてしまった","ts":"1622375661.468100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ygL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5533c8e0-2640-4a4e-a861-ccde5c30886b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"nettleのビルド時