1/.local/share/info/gmp.info-1\n/home/u1/.local/include/gmp.h```","ts":"1622374537.459300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9tMd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48c88181-3caa-4246-adbd-23099eeea755","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`LD_LIBRARY_PATH` はあくまで実行時のものですから","ts":"1622374521.458600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gaXE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"619e2936-176e-473c-9016-815efb93a00e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"LD_LIBRARY_PATHだけだとだめなんかな...?","ts":"1622374462.457700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V4/B+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"604855e3-1249-427d-b30e-567f82b80285","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"上のからすると、pkg-configじゃなくて、パスをつかって -lgmp でライブラリがリンクするか見てるみたいだけど...\nlibのpath解決が謎だねえ","ts":"1622374411.457400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kuMB2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e94110b1-587c-463b-8a73-150e3db7f1e4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ビルドするときにpkg-config勝手に見に行ってくれるもんだと思っていたが、間違ってるのかな〜","ts":"1622374336.456200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KIs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cda36e66-639b-4f2d-b1d1-0261c19e0bbe","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"gmpも自分でビルドして、`pkg-config --list-all` すると一覧にgmpあります","ts":"1622374246.455700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S=WIw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"093a8905-3c18-454f-823f-ac1c2d98f239","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いれてある? \u0026gt; gmp","ts":"1622374233.455400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qUl4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49943dfe-dbe0-4325-ac92-87d3b