lock_id":"dPbkl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45096bab-a8b0-4e78-b6e7-6d84873385b2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"shellcheckでposix標準にしつつ、そうじゃないならちゃんと/bin/bashにしてbashの機能全開で書く..(そこまで詳しくないから、大差はないが)","ts":"1622357447.443400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JVF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"976efeb1-9746-4cf1-baa8-b0fe1bf616a2","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"私もそれでいっかってなりました","ts":"1622356441.442400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"564u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97f036de-9e0b-4c33-bd73-d1b924b7cbda","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"BSD？POSIX？知らない子ですねぇ…みたいな","ts":"1622356422.441800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7L6T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab9d3b4f-076d-49f2-97ae-cf0eb80a551b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"最近シバンは `#!/bin/bash`  を迷わず書くようになってる","ts":"1622356397.441400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U022XK5866Q","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J+Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dcd1eb9-45de-4355-aee9-c2fbb5f63cb1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```$ ls -l /bin/sh\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 4 Feb 19  2019 /bin/sh -\u0026gt; bash```\nUbuntu 18.04 LTS だと bash だった","ts":"1622356354.441000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uK=H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64394f91-a7cb-4467-b396-997c2305f857","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"debian固有ですね、bash使ってないのは","ts":"1622356322.440500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+H3w="}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f8c1941-74f8-4312-8769-d5a650dde768","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"そうなんですね……。その辺り全然分かってなかったです。dockerのdebian busterは/bin/shがbashじゃなかったので、manjaroとか一部のディストロの話なのかと思ってました。","ts":"1622356288.440000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wH0I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d46630e-c2aa-461e-a1e9-232237b7e5c8","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"大抵の `/bin/sh` は `bash` ですねー\nalpine は違いますが…","ts":"1622356104.438800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MDvc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e063224-a921-4832-9224-aac06c02ab28","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`[[`が非POSIXと知らずに `#!/bin/sh`で使ってDockerで走らせて怒られました。\nまさかローカルのshがbashにシンボリックリンク貼ってるなんて思ってなかった……というダブルな罠。","ts":"1622355974.437700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ZSsP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9707663D-137E-4754-A3A8-F53864A5861C","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"基本[[で書きますね","ts":"1622355347.436200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+tE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10ce42f9-934e-45a4-ba19-60768e23a819","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"`[[`  は内部コマンドなので変数展開もquoteいらないとか便利","ts":"1622352710.435700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CVDJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73cecba3-0c8b-464e-806b-d79021e6428c","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"へえ、`[[` のほうが安全で高機能なんですね。知らなかった :tiken:","ts":"1622350346.434700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xUqe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fff9db8c-d044-4720-8845-ac1208d22485","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"なるほどなあ","ts":"1622348912.434100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ts